# The build scripts and patches run in Linux containers, so they stay LF on every checkout,
# Windows included.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Except the ProSystem patch, whose lines for ProSystem's CRLF files carry their CRs, byte for byte.
netplay/patches/prosystem.patch -text
# And the ClownMDEmu patch (both copies), whose lines for the core's CRLF controller-manager.c carry theirs.
netplay/patches/clownmdemu.patch -text
clownmdemu/patches/clownmdemu.patch -text
